OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAA decade after a critical health
OL,4,Aservice review, has there been any
OL,5,Achange?
OL,6,
OL,7,FA decade ago Northern Ireland's health
OL,8,Fservice was likened to a "burning
OL,9,Fplatform" - where there was such urgent
OL,10,Fpressure that "standing still is no
OL,11,Flonger a viable option".
OL,13,FThe man who described it that way, Prof
OL,14,FRaphael Bengoa, published a 2016 review
OL,15,Fthat was supposed to change the way
OL,16,FNorthern Ireland does healthcare.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,420,410,260,120,0,100
PN,41902
SC,0002
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F419A1791455165
OL,1,W5j 5Q7k jjs%wsj  w{j#57i
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAA decade after a critical health
OL,4,Aservice review, has there been any
OL,5,Achange?
OL,6,
OL,7,FHis proposition was practical but
OL,8,Fambitious - that a system under
OL,9,Frelentless pressure could not simply
OL,10,Ftreat more patients, run similar
OL,11,Fservices in different hospitals and
OL,12,Fspend more money.
OL,14,FThe name Bengoa came to represent
OL,15,Fsomething that Northern Ireland's
OL,16,Fhealth service desperately needed: the
OL,17,Fpossibility of improvement and change.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
